    text: "Affected stops:\r\n23rd Ave & Glencoe St (#10583) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Holly St (#10585) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Jasmine St (#10592) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Leyden St (#10595) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Leyden St (#10596) (westbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Jasmine St (#10591) (westbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Holly St (#10586) (westbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Glencoe St (#10582) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\n23rd Ave & Elm St (#10576)\r\n23rd Ave & Monaco Pkwy (#10599)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\n23rd Ave & Monaco Pkwy (#10600)\r\n23rd Ave & Elm St (#10577)"
